WEBVTT

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:03.381
Reduce infrastructure spend by up to sixty percent.

00:00:04.292 --> 00:00:06.906
Upstairs and downstairs, all eight lights are on.

00:00:07.833 --> 00:00:09.136
The family leaves.

00:00:09.136 --> 00:00:10.602
Every window stays bright.

00:00:11.542 --> 00:00:13.810
Eight lamps burn for eight empty hours.

00:00:13.810 --> 00:00:16.306
That's ninety-six cents to light an empty house.

00:00:17.208 --> 00:00:18.478
Replay the night.

00:00:18.478 --> 00:00:20.689
The last person switches off the lights.

00:00:20.689 --> 00:00:22.643
Same eight hours, zero cents.

00:00:23.583 --> 00:00:24.946
Someone comes home.

00:00:24.946 --> 00:00:26.417
Only their room lights up.

00:00:27.333 --> 00:00:28.847
Each window is a pod.

00:00:28.847 --> 00:00:31.368
SlimFaas is the front door for requests.

00:00:32.292 --> 00:00:36.939
At ten euros per pod-hour, eight idle pods cost eighty euros in one hour.

00:00:37.875 --> 00:00:41.468
After the idle timeout, SlimFaas scales the app to zero.

00:00:41.468 --> 00:00:43.822
Another quiet hour adds zero euros.

00:00:44.750 --> 00:00:46.575
One request wakes a pod.

00:00:46.575 --> 00:00:48.311
More requests light up the house.

00:00:49.250 --> 00:00:50.727
Demand keeps climbing.

00:00:50.727 --> 00:00:52.496
Eight windows become thirty-two.

00:00:53.417 --> 00:00:54.923
Now picture Versailles.

00:00:54.923 --> 00:00:58.204
Ninety-six windows glow, all behind the same front door.

00:00:59.125 --> 00:01:03.399
Try SlimFaas in five minutes with your existing HTTP app.

00:01:03.399 --> 00:01:05.303
Keep your language and your handler.

00:01:06.208 --> 00:01:07.492
Building an agent?

00:01:07.492 --> 00:01:10.410
Stream files, cache results, and publish events.

00:01:10.410 --> 00:01:13.511
Replay streams, queue jobs, and trace requests.

00:01:13.511 --> 00:01:16.384
All over HTTP, without an SDK.

00:01:17.292 --> 00:01:19.495
One team saved over sixty percent.

00:01:19.495 --> 00:01:24.388
At sixty percent, a ten-thousand-euro monthly bill drops to four thousand.

00:01:24.388 --> 00:01:26.849
That's six thousand euros saved each month.

00:01:27.750 --> 00:01:32.107
Keep that up for twelve months and you save seventy-two thousand euros.

00:01:32.107 --> 00:01:37.442
Your yearly bill goes from one hundred and twenty thousand euros to forty-eight thousand.

00:01:37.442 --> 00:01:38.964
Give SlimFaas a try.

00:01:38.964 --> 00:01:40.524
Help keep my home on the ice!
